    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duäc Kuɔth Nhial kɛ A-thi-ri-ya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wä Kuäär ni Kuoth thuɔ̱k kɛ lätni nyinäkɛ diaal Pääm Dha-yɔn kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, bɛ kuäär A-thi-ri-ya däk kɛ kui̱ liakädɛ kɛnɛ kapdɛ kɛ rɔ nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö cɛ wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luny duɔthni nath jɔk pec",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ /ci duɔth ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kɛn tin ci kään dhɔr Je-kɔb rɔ̱ bilɛ thieŋ ram in näkɛ, kɛ thuɔ̱k bikɛ rɔ̱ thieŋ Kuoth Nhial jɛn Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi duɔth nath luny jɔk, kɛn duɔth ji̱ dhɔaar Je-kɔb bikɛ luny kä Kuoth in leny buɔ̱mdɛ ti diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cäŋ bi nɛɛku ŋuan ce̱tnikɛ liɛt thuɔk yiëër lö I-thɛ-rɛl, bi luny ni duɔth jɔk. Ci Kuoth da̱k muɔ̱ɔ̱n lat, bɛ jɛ däk kɛɛliw a päär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa ɛ moc kɛ guut, ce̱tnikɛ mëë ca lar kɛ kui̱ wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛɛliw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ ci Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa wee i̱, “Lö nɛɛkä tin cieŋ kä Dha-yɔn, /cuarɛ dual kɛ ji̱ A-thi-ri-ya tin dua̱ckɛ yɛ kɛ kɛtni, tin kapkɛ kɛtni nhial kɛ kui̱dun ce̱tnikɛ mëë ca lät kä yɛ ɛ ji̱ I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö kɛ gua̱a̱th mi tɔt bi gakdä kɛ yɛ thuɔ̱k, kä bi ŋɛ̈ɛ̈nydä wa̱a̱ ni duŋ däkädiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa kɛ duäc kɛ waat, ce̱tkɛ mëë cɛ ji̱ Mid-yan duäc pääm O-reb. Kä bɛ kɛɛtdɛ riɛny wi̱i̱ pi̱i̱ni ce̱tkɛ mëë cɛ la̱t kä I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ bi rik tin la̱t kɛ kä yɛ cu thil, kä bä gäkdiɛn cu woc ŋuääkdun.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
